WEBVTT

00:00.100 --> 00:05.600
[Electronic music rises. A soft whoosh introduces the card.]

00:06.000 --> 00:10.000
[Four chimes rise as the card generates its key.]

00:12.000 --> 00:17.500
[A beat starts. Eight ascending notes mark the pieces of eCash loading.]

00:20.420 --> 00:24.300
[A tap, followed by clicks and beeps as the phone reads the card.]

00:26.600 --> 00:28.900
[Three beeps as the till selects three pieces.]

00:29.200 --> 00:32.000
[A chime marks the signature. Three crackles follow.]

00:34.400 --> 00:37.300
[Two bells as the till accepts the payment offline.]

00:38.400 --> 00:41.700
[The connection chirps. A chord sounds as the mint settles the payment.]

00:42.000 --> 00:48.000
[The music rises once more. A final chord rings out.]
